# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale de
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as [00:00, 05:00).
# Sources: Duden (https://www.duden.de/rechtschreibung/Vormittag), which
# gives Vormittag as the "Zeit zwischen Morgen und Mittag".
# The Nacht is the small hours of the named day; the Abend holds the
# evening through to midnight on its own.
nacht
nachts
